 🦬  Hairy (2)   🪒  Shaving (1)   🐑  Shorn (1)   🕒  Recent (4)   ⭐  Starred (0)   📖  Wiki (0)   🛖  Sh

◂ Help — keys
│   /             Inline search
│   #             Go to any yak by id / title
│   f             Filter drawer
│   Esc           Revert filter to the active view
│
│ Farm git state (the chip on the tab row)
│   W             Commit the farm (yaks commit)
│   U             Sync the farm: commit, pull, push (yaks sync)
│   auto          Syncs itself every sync_interval (config.yaml, default 5m; off)
│   chip          ● N uncommitted, ↑ahead, ↓behind, not published; none when clean
│
│ Wiki tab (the farm's pages and sources)
│   j / k         Move between pages (then sources)
│   Enter / l     Open in the viewer: frontmatter above the body; a source with its extracted text
│   /             Search titles, paths, kinds and tags (Esc clears)
│   E             Edit the page: frontmatter (YAML) and body; Ctrl-S saves
j/k scroll · d/u page · g/G top/bottom · ?/q/Esc close
